# Hash Bags capture harness — local configuration TEMPLATE.
#
# Copy to tools/demo/demo.env (which is gitignored) and fill in.
# Per ~/src/docs/engineering/developer-workstations.md: human credentials live
# in Vaultwarden; ignored development values sit beside the worktree; only
# reviewed templates get committed.
#
#     cp tools/demo/demo.env.example tools/demo/demo.env
#
# NEVER put the demo wallet seed in this file. It is fetched from Vaultwarden
# at capture time. NEVER put the Vaultwarden hostname in a committed file
# either — that is infrastructure detail and does not belong in a public repo.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vaultwarden
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Your self-hosted server URL. Set it here (this file is gitignored), then:
#     bw config server "$VAULTWARDEN_SERVER"
#     bw login
#     export BW_SESSION=$(bw unlock --raw)
VAULTWARDEN_SERVER=https://vault.example.internal

# Name of the Vaultwarden item holding the demo wallet. The seed may live in
# the item's notes, its password field, or a custom field named `seed`.
VAULTWARDEN_ITEM=hash-bags-demo-wallet

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Demo wallet presentation
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Which chain is the face of the app in store material. Hash Bags is
# Wownero-first. One of: wownero | monero | bitcoin | litecoin
DEMO_WALLET_TYPE=wownero

# Destination shown on the Send screen. This APPEARS ON CAMERA — use an
# address you are happy to publish. Defaulting it to the demo wallet's own
# receive address avoids putting a stranger's address in a store listing.
DEMO_SEND_ADDRESS=

# Amounts typed on camera. Nothing is ever broadcast by the scenarios.
DEMO_SEND_AMOUNT=0.5
DEMO_SWAP_AMOUNT=10

# PIN entered during capture (digits only).
DEMO_PIN=0801

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Capture targets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AVD created by the harness at exactly 1080x1920 (16:9). Do not point this at
# a 1080x2400 phone AVD: that is 2.22:1 and Google Play rejects phone
# screenshots with an aspect ratio above 2:1.
DEMO_AVD=HashBags_Capture

# Where captures and renders land. Kept out of the repo on purpose.
DEMO_OUT_ROOT=$HOME/Build/hash-wallet/demo

# Optional music bed baked into the `social` reel. Ignored by apple-preview.
# DEMO_MUSIC=/home/jw/src/meatspace/assets/music/instrumental_vibey.mp3
